<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chile's CTC downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chile's CTC downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said analyst Peter Treadway lowered his rating on Compania de Telecomunicaciones de Chile SA to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- in a report said move &quot;is largely based on slight downward revision of our growth estimates, partly inspired by 2Q97 results, and on valuation considerations.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said lowered earnings per American Depositary Receipt five-year growth estimate for CTC to 12 percent from 13 percent.</p>
</text>
